ket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1582834251","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1990#issuecomment-1582834251","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1990","id":1582834251,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE85eWCJL","user":{"login":"swinslow","id":678569,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3ODU2OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/678569?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow","html_url":"https://github.com/swinslow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2023-06-08T15:31:52Z","updated_at":"2023-06-08T15:31:52Z","body":"This one is quite close to [HPND](https://spdx.org/licenses/HPND.html), but different enough that I don't think it's worth trying to further modify the markup to squeeze it in there.\r\n\r\n+1 to add as a simple historical permissive license found in Fedora.\r\n\r\nI wouldn't go with the name \"Lucent\", though, for a variety of reasons, including that there's already a [Lucent Public License](https://spdx.org/licenses/LPL-1.0.html) on the list.\r\n\r\nLooks like the license originates with the \"dtoa\" package from David M. Gay: see for example https://netlib.sandia.gov/fp/g_fmt.c and https://stuff.mit.edu/afs/athena/software/texmaker_v5.0.2/qt57/doc/qtwebengine/qtwebengine-3rdparty-david-m-gay-s-floating-point-routines.html.\r\n\r\n(There's also a \"gdtoa\" package with David M. Gay / Lucent which is close but appears to be a different license -- e.g. https://www.ibm.com/docs/en/icos/22.1.0?topic=terms-acknowledgment-use-dtoa-routine-gdtoa-package; https://opensource.apple.com/source/Libc/Libc-391/gdtoa/FreeBSD/gdtoa-dtoa.c.auto.html)\r\n\r\nGiven all of that -- perhaps `dtoa` as ID and \"David M. Gay dtoa License\" as name? Open to alternatives, but I wouldn't use \"Lucent\" as the ID / name, at least not standing alone.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1582834251/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1583012655","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1990#issuecomment-1583012655","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1990","id":1583012655,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE85eWtsv","user":{"login":"jlovejoy","id":5048659,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwNDg2NTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5048659?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy","html_url":"https://github.com/jlovejoy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/user